{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Ferrah, a shimmering, tall, kaleidoscope-skinned goddess takes the stage, her Faerie dragon perched on her back, giving her the appearance of having butterfly wings. She wears a rainbow sequined jacket with long coattails, and a matching vest, tophat, and skirt. She casts a spell upon the stage. A sparkly, transparent bubble appears around the stage. Her voice, in common, carries over the crowd,","created_at":"2021-07-23T01:40:23.399000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867944202078670868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Grimlock is wearing a pretty hat, courtesy of Sabrine.","created_at":"2021-07-23T01:40:54.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867944333263917066","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"“Welcome Faedies and Gentlethems! Welcome one and all! We have asked you here today for a much needed lifting of spirits, and if there’s one thing we Fae know how to do, its have a good time! Food and drinks from our booths are on the house (nothing magical, feel free to rp what you eat and drink), indulge yourselves, sit back, and enjoy the entertainment!” She pauses, soaking in the applause. “Now for the nitty gritty. Tonight’s pageant will be judged based on the participation of contestants in three different categories: Best dressed, best story teller, and most talented. The scores will be tallied at the end, and the winner will walk away with 1000g! Shall we begin?!” The crow roars. (Anyone on stage can communicate in any language aloud and be understood by the crowd)","created_at":"2021-07-23T01:40:59.844000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867944354940059679","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"“Now to introduce our contestants and begin the category of BEST DRESSED!”","created_at":"2021-07-23T01:42:32.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867944741931733013","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Round 1: Best dressed\nPaint us a mind picture of what you’re wearing, post a photo or describe it in words. I will roll a d6 to see the crowd’s reaction. You will roll a d20 and add my roll as your modifier. Advantage can be granted.","created_at":"2021-07-23T01:42:52.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867944826312728577","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
