{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Strolling across the stage with class Finn walks with confidence. His normal red carpet walk, but when many prepared for blacktie he came in fabulous ***PATRIOTIC BLUE*** \n\nNavy slacks up to a 3 piece suit, lower sets of golden buttons with painted stars on them end at a wide lapel revealing a red vest and a white dress shirt bedazzled with Fae friendly gems.\n\nAround his neck sits a bowtie that draws in those around him. 2 white Stars on either flat of it.\n\nHis hair is voluminous and his mustache...oh his mustache is ***MAGNIFICENT***","created_at":"2021-07-23T01:46:27.000000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867945727131795548","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
