{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"The nameless walks into the stage, a little bit nervous at the thought of showcasing himself, but he's in this to have fun so he strides with confidence.\nThe nameless is sporting a leather jacket with a lot of straps and pockets, a perfect representation of urban fashion. On the right breast pocket is a glamours pilot wing emblem with diamonds, turning his outfit from biker to dashing aviator. The look is completed with leather pants with the same copious amounts of straps and big clunky army boots, completing his chic milirary aesthetic. The last act was the uncle finn serving as the figure head for the revolution, the nameless this time is representing the muscle needed to bring glory to the revolution.","created_at":"2021-07-23T01:53:29.521000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867947499313315900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
